WEBVTT

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:01.453 line:86%
And finally,

00:00:01.493 --> 00:00:03.461 line:86%
let me explain how the History

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:04.201 line:86%
tab works.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.108 line:86%
Here you'll find the last 10

00:00:06.148 --> 00:00:08.209 line:86%
images generated in the plugin,

00:00:08.249 --> 00:00:09.689 line:86%
from all your projects.

00:00:09.729 --> 00:00:11.353 line:86%
You can also see how many

00:00:11.393 --> 00:00:13.190 line:86%
credits you've used so far.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.009 line:86%
And if you forgot to download

00:00:15.049 --> 00:00:16.141 line:86%
an image, just click

00:00:16.181 --> 00:00:17.370 line:86%
the download button.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.229 line:86%
Or if you prefer to clear

00:00:28.269 --> 00:00:29.230 line:86%
the whole history,

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:30.740 line:86%
just press that red button.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:31.586 line:86%
But careful:

00:00:31.626 --> 00:00:33.490 line:86%
once the history is erased,

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:34.654 line:86%
you won't be able

00:00:34.694 --> 00:00:36.248 line:86%
to recover anything that was

00:00:36.288 --> 00:00:36.988 line:86%
deleted.

